      "en": "Throughout each and every province where the king’s edict and law were announced[NOTE:1] there was considerable[NOTE:2] mourning among the Jews, along with fasting, weeping, and sorrow.[NOTE:3] Sackcloth and ashes were characteristic[NOTE:4] of many.",
